        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, passenger car
Data are based on a LCI analysis of the Golf A4;
UUID: 96151dcf-d2fe-3a20-bbf4-ff542777285c
The inventory includes materials used for alteration parts and energy consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for
Location: Data represent German conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents maintenance of a modern vehicle
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data is taken from LCI analysis of a Golf A4. 
Extrapolations: Data  for Germany is used as an first estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_96151dcf-d2fe-3a20-bbf4-ff542777285c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
